{"created": "2022-07-13T01:33:47.719934+00:00", "modified": "2024-07-16T10:06:46.951166+00:00", "id": 6824749, "conceptrecid": "6640512", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.6824749", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.6640512", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6824749", "metadata": {"title": "The SDSS Peculiar Velocity Catalogue", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.6824749", "publication_date": "2022-06-14", "description": "<p>Data, randoms and mock galaxy catalogues for the <em>Sloan Digital Sky Survey Peculiar Velocity Catalogue</em>; Howlett et. al., 2022, MNRAS, in press. See arXiv:2201.03112 for more details.</p>\n\n<p>Changelog:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>1.1.0:\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Fixed error in v1.0.0 in specObjID column caused (at some point in the pipeline) due to rounding errors when reading/writing large numbers. v1.1.0 has the correct specObjIDs. Note that &#39;objid&#39; is correct in both versions of the SDSS PV catalogue, and our recommended method to crossmatch to the spectroscopic SDSS data (wherein the corresponding column to match with is &#39;bestobjid&#39;).</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Cullan Howlett", "affiliation": "The University of Queensland"}, {"name": "Khaled Said", "affiliation": "The University of Queensland"}, {"name": "John R. Lucey", "affiliation": "Durham University"}, {"name": "Matthew Colless", "affiliation": "Australian National University"}, {"name": "Fei Qin", "affiliation": "Korea Astronomy and Space Science Institute"}, {"name": "Yan Lai", "affiliation": "The University of Queensland"}, {"name": "R. Brent Tully", "affiliation": "Institute for Astronomy"}, {"name": "Tamara M. Davis", "affiliation": "The University of Queensland"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "2022arXiv220103112H", "relation": "isDescribedBy", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "ads"}], "version": "1.1.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}